OWNED REQUEST JOURNAL — seq | kind | outcome | phase (owning step) | path
Every request the page made, in the order it made it. `phase` is the step in
force when the request was issued; `start` is the bootstrap, before any step ran.
`outcome` is what became of it: completed, held (parked in flight), released
(let go by a later step), or failed.

